{"id":"technique:msvc-rtti-recovery","name":"MSVC RTTI recovery","aliases":["rtti","rtti scan","MSVC RTTI","vtable recovery","class recovery"],"summary":"Recover C++ class names, vtables and inheritance from MSVC run-time type information with rtti_scan.py, no disassembler needed."}
{"id":"technique:string-xref-pivot","name":"String to function pivot","aliases":["string xref","string xrefs","debug string pivot"],"summary":"Find the code (or table) that references a string to locate a feature; strings referenced only from data point to tables."}
