{"id":"technique:runtime-memory-sampler","name":"Runtime memory sampler","aliases":["memory sampler","process memory sampling","read-only memory sampler"],"summary":"Read-only sampling of an owned single-player game's process memory at a fixed rate to measure live structures (controller shape, positions). Offline only; no anti-cheat involved; nothing is written to the process."}
{"id":"technique:paired-same-binary-probe","name":"Paired same-binary probe","aliases":["paired probe","A/B probe","same-binary comparison"],"summary":"Compare raw versus changed behaviour with the same build, the same scripted driver and the same start placement, using a named metric; compare rows, not single digits."}
