{"id":"technique:round-trip-oracle","name":"Round-trip oracle","aliases":["round trip","parse write compare"],"summary":"Decode, re-encode and compare with the original bytes (or a stated error bound) to prove a parser or format reading."}
{"id":"approach:static-recompilation","name":"Static recompilation","aliases":["static recomp","recompilation","AOT recompilation","recomp"],"summary":"Translate the original machine code to C/C++ ahead of time and supply a runtime that reimplements the console or OS."}
{"id":"approach:clean-room-reimplementation","name":"Clean-room reimplementation","aliases":["clean-room","clean room","reimplementation","engine reimplementation"],"summary":"New engine with the same rules reading the user's own data files; verified against the original's behaviour."}
