{"id":"approach:matching-decompilation","name":"Matching decompilation","aliases":["decomp","byte-matching decompilation"],"summary":"Recover source that rebuilds the original bytes, function by function, with the original compiler."}
{"id":"approach:native-hooking","name":"Native hooking","aliases":["hooking","native hooks","dll injection mod"],"summary":"Offline single-player runtime modding by code injected into the process; resolve targets by signature or RTTI, not fixed addresses."}
{"id":"project:openoblivion","name":"OpenOblivion","aliases":["Open Oblivion"],"url":"https://github.com/madpai/OpenOblivion","summary":"1:1 port of Oblivion for Android on a patched OpenMW; owner's project and the first consumer of this compendium; the source of most movement and collision records here."}
