{"id":"problem:silent-asset-load-failure","name":"Failed model load substituted by an error marker","aliases":["error marker mesh","silent asset failure"],"cues":["blocked","doorway","error marker","failed to load","cannot pass"],"summary":"A model that fails to load is replaced by an embedded marker mesh, so a body or prop silently has the wrong size."}
